{"version":1,"content":"<p>前亞姐冠軍吳綺莉（Elaine）近日作客HOY清談節目《九運會客室2》。</p><p>節目中，她大方回應多年來圍繞在她與女兒吳卓林（小龍女）身上的種種傳聞，不僅首度正面澄清撫養費疑雲，更分享了如今與女兒相處的全新境界。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:19.510627+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:49:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T07:18:18.130256+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:18:18.130256+00:00","content_hash":"3727a20149c01f7b3f4492ae5099f69ef558a5018f74beb0e9efde5e0f9d27ef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}